 that captures issues, attempts, decisions, and cross-project library gotchas\n\n## Key Concepts\n\nThe research indicates that agent memory is becoming \"a distinct cognitive substrate rather than a side effect of context window management,\" suggesting this is evolving into a fundamental architectural component of AI coding agents rather than just a feature.\n\nWould you like me to search for more specific information about any of these projects or concepts?\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."
